# Installers
error-inst-bundle-unavailable = The files ordin needs to set this up are missing or damaged. Reinstall ordin.
error-inst-folder-not-empty = That folder already has some of the files. Choose an empty folder.
error-inst-folder-unavailable = The agent's folder is missing. Restore it or choose another.
error-inst-harness-unsupported = ordin doesn't support that coding assistant yet. Use Claude Code.
error-inst-import-cycle = Some files refer to each other in a loop or are nested too deeply. Simplify them.
error-inst-loop-unsupported = That way of repeating work isn't supported for this agent. Choose another.
error-inst-not-installed = Nothing has been installed here yet, so there is nothing to update or remove.
error-inst-path-invalid = A file name isn't allowed. Use a simple name without folder jumps or special characters.
error-inst-record-invalid = ordin can't read the record of what it installed. Install again to rebuild it.
error-inst-repair-failed = ordin couldn't repair this install. Try installing again.
error-inst-write-failed = ordin couldn't save, rename or delete a file. Check there is free space and that the folder isn't locked, then try again.
